WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.732
Welcome to Module 11. We already know how to create and work with DataFrames.

00:00:05.732 --> 00:00:14.857
Now we’ll focus on the Pandas patterns that make larger analytical workflows cleaner and more useful.

00:00:14.857 --> 00:00:20.412
We’ll chain operations, reshape tables, work with dates, calculate rolling summaries, check joins,

00:00:20.412 --> 00:00:24.506
and package repeated steps into functions.

00:00:24.956 --> 00:00:28.458
The goal is not to memorize every Pandas method.

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:35.437
Focus on recognizing the data problem and choosing a transformation that moves the table toward the form you need.
